#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# b_spline_curve

#% text
# `b_spline_curve([p1, p2, ...])` is a smooth curve with the points as its control points: a clamped uniform cubic B-spline from the first point to the last.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
graphics([thick, b_spline_curve([[0, 0], [1, 2], [2, -1], [3, 1], [4, 0]]), red, point([[0, 0], [1, 2], [2, -1], [3, 1], [4, 0]])])
